{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55838","headline":"清源山（题拟） · 钱熙","name":"清源山（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巍峨堆压郡城阴，秀出天涯（《泉州府志》作「崖」）几万寻。\n翠影倒时吞半郭，岚光凝处滴疎林。\n（见《古今图书集成·山川典》卷一八五《泉山部》、同治庚午年刊黄任等纂《泉州府志》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱熙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55838.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55838","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}